      "markdown": "55.\n\n∵  $ S_{\\Delta COD} = 4 $ ∴  $ S_{\\Delta AOD} = 2 $\n\n故  $ S_{梯形ABCD} = 1 + 2 + 2 + 4 = 9 $\n\n8. 如图$\\triangle ABCD$，F为BC中点，延长AD至E，使DE:AD=1:3，连EF交DC于点G，则$S_{\\triangle DEG}:S_{\\triangle OFG}=$\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"imgs/img_in_image_box_649_1242_1914_2029.jpg\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"50%\" /></div>\n\n\n解：∵四边形ABCD为平行四边形\n\n∴DE∥FC, AD=BC\n\n∵DE:AD=1:3 ∴DE:BC=1:3\n\n又∵F为BC中点 ∴DE:FC=2:3\n\n又∵DE∥FC ∴△DEG∽△CFG\n\n∴ $ \\frac{DE}{FC}=\\frac{2}{3} $为相似比\n\n∴ $ \\frac{S_{\\Delta DEG}}{S_{\\Delta CFG}}=\\left(\\frac{2}{3}\\right)^2=\\frac{4}{9} $",
